sg-session (0.1.0-4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The desktop is sized to the compositor output (SG_DESKTOP_AUTO=0 keeps a
    fixed size).
  * Machine-level scripts never inherit a display.
  * Session gate: SG_TEST_HOLD debugging hook.

